OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver dies in hospital
OL,4,Afollowing crash in Angus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 62-year-old man has died in hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a single-vehicle crash in
OL,8,FAngus at the weekend.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,FC22 road between Cardean and Ruthven,
OL,12,Fnorth of Meigle, at about 01:05 on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FThe man, who was driving a white
OL,16,FCitroen Berlingo van, was taken to
OL,17,FNinewells Hospital in Dundee where he
OL,18,Fdied on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
