OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver dies in hospital
OL,4,Afollowing crash in Angus
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said its investigation
OL,7,Finto the crash remained ongoing, and
OL,8,Fappealed for anyone with information to
OL,9,Fget in touch.
